sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as 사용자
  participant UI as React 화면
  participant LS as localStorage JWT
  participant API as Express index.js
  participant MW as authMiddleware
  participant DB as db.js
  participant PR as prompts/*
  participant AI as OpenAI
  participant EXT as MDM/APNs/Solapi

  U->>UI: 탭/입력
  UI->>LS: 토큰 읽기
  UI->>API: fetch Bearer + JSON
  API->>MW: JWT 검증
  alt 학생 + 웹 차단
    MW-->>UI: 403
  else 통과
    MW->>DB: SQL
    opt AI 필요
      API->>PR: system/user 프롬프트
      PR->>AI: chat.completions
      AI-->>API: 텍스트/JSON
    end
    opt 푸시/MDM
      API->>EXT: 외부 API
    end
    DB-->>API: rows
    API-->>UI: JSON 응답
    UI-->>U: 화면 갱신
  end
